{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mantian-e-o093","title":"豫聚粪燃烟从他道引去","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-1a94e5577c200393c493","label":"正文","text":"田豫结屯聚牛马粪燃烟，从他道引去；胡追至马城围之十重","evidence":["mantian-q-627573b6908e8c384275"]},{"id":"mantian-a-5d0ed5d80953cb96ed3a","label":"正文","text":"太和二年田豫为轲比能围于故马城移招求救","evidence":["mantian-q-27f1c6fdf5e99913a4d2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0025","role":"进军去虏十余里结屯营、多聚牛马粪燃之、从他道引去；胡见烟火不绝以为尚在、行数十里乃知之、追豫到马城围之十重","evidence":["mantian-q-627573b6908e8c384275","mantian-q-27f1c6fdf5e99913a4d2"]},{"person":"wendi-p0032","role":"围田豫于马城","evidence":["mantian-q-27f1c6fdf5e99913a4d2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-627573b6908e8c384275"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-627573b6908e8c384275","source_order":[26,143,86],"evidence":["mantian-q-27f1c6fdf5e99913a4d2"],"order":5190}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0025","name":"田豫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0032","name":"轲比能","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-27f1c6fdf5e99913a4d2","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b3a5e0dd44cfcc9fe5d4","layer":"original","quote":"太和二年，护乌丸校尉田豫出塞，为轲比能所围于故马城，移招求救〖1〗","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-627573b6908e8c384275","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-7f6f254bf33b511a75d0","layer":"original","quote":"豫乃进军，去虏十余里结屯营；多聚牛马粪燃之，从他道引去。胡见烟火不绝，以为尚在；去，行数十里乃知之。追豫到马城〖8〗，围之十重","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":101,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_po